            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "c. If a dependent child is covered under both parents' group plans, the child's primary coverage is provided through the plan of the parent whose birthday comes first in the calendar year, with secondary coverage provided through the plan of the parent whose birthday comes later in the calendar year.",
            "block_bbox": [
                124,
                68,
