                    95.0,
                    968.0
                ]
            ]
        },
        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "Plan means any plan providing medical, dental, vision care, heating aid benefits, or treatment under individual insurance, group insurance, or any other coverage for individuals in a group, whether on an insured or uninsured basis.",
