            "block_content": "Treatment of end-stage renal disease is covered by the Traditional Medical Plan for the first thirty (30) months following Medicare entitlement due to end-stage renal disease, and Medicare provides secondary coverage. After this thirty (30)-month period, Medicare provides primary coverage and the Traditional Medical Plan provides secondary coverage.",
